OL,3,AWhat happened to Harry and Meghan's
OL,4,AAmerican dream?
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen the Duke and Duchess of Sussex
OL,7,Fquit working for the Royal Family in
OL,8,F2020 and moved to California, they
OL,9,Fbrought something even Hollywood can't
OL,10,Fmanufacture: royalty.
OL,12,FBut while Harry and Meghan enjoyed some
OL,13,Fsuccess in showbusiness, their
OL,14,FHollywood reign proved short-lived and
OL,15,FCalifornia has greeted news of their
OL,16,Fdeparture back to the UK with a shrug.
OL,18,FIn pursuing their American dream, they
OL,19,Fsaid they were seeking more than
OL,20,Ffinancial independence.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
