OL,3,AWhat happened to Harry and Meghan's
OL,4,AAmerican dream?
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn their 2021 blockbuster interview
OL,7,Fwith Oprah Winfrey, Meghan described
OL,8,Fthe freedom to make her own choices as
OL,9,F"liberating".
